id: pm-github-aiok
title: Adopt the released gated sync caller in fleet repositories
description: "After the gated extension is published and its exact quality gates pass, replace the release commit and version placeholders in docs/sync-workflow-caller.yml and migrate the disabled pm-graph, pm-jira, and pm-todos sync callers to the single reusable implementation. Keep automated workflows disabled until the owner authorizes rollout. The current candidate is confined to pm-github and must not modify or dispatch workflows in other repositories. Verify a fresh nonempty import, malicious no-push fixtures, repeat idempotency, and permanent changed-item links in each authorized caller rollout."
